WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.320
Okay, pencils down!

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.450
It's finally over.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.120
How'd you do, Yuuka?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.170
Not good at all.

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.330
I'm doomed.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.420
Say, what are you doing for summer vacation, Sayuri?

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:34.920
Let me see.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:38.010
There's something I'd like to try.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:43.640
I'll be busy with club activities, so I probably won't have time to relax.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.350
I see. That sounds tough.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.440
Let's enjoy our summer vacation.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:57.860
An Exciting Confession

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:03.160
Final exams are over now, but summer vacation hasn't started yet.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:12.380
Final Exams

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.240
Don't relax just yet, everyone.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.240
Yes!

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.460
Okay, that's all for today.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.380
See you later, everyone.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.800
Summer vacation's coming up soon.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:22.430
Final Exams

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.340
Yo! Aoba.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:25.550
Hey, Riku-kun, are you going somewhere with your family?

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.270
I don't really have any plans...

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.060
Then let's go to the beach!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:31.850
The beach!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:37.980
No! Let's go to an amateur manga convention for budding doujinshi artists!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:41.070
Flyer reads "Summer Beach Volleyball"

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.990
Since it's summer, let's do this!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:42.990
Doujima-kun?!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.410
Beads of sweat, dancing ladies...

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.870
You've gotta see it in summer!

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.040
Summer Beach Volleyball

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:54.210
Right? Right?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.790
Um...

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.420
That's...

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.170
That's right, Doujima-kun.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.300
Oh, you understand, Kayama!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.050
Of course I do!

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:08.390
Beautiful girls exposing their bodies and running around the beach!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:12.020
When I think about it, I can't stop crying!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.890
Kayama-chan!

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:15.150
Doujima-chan!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:20.110
We're soul mates!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.030
I'm happy for you both.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.070
You have something in common.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.870
Well, I guess we should get going soon.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.210
What're you gonna do? Shall we go somewhere first?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.210
Let me think...

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.460
Let's stop by a convenience store or something.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.420
Is Aoba Riku here?!

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:43.970
I'm here.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.090
The student council would like to see you in person.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.970
Come to the student council office at once.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:50.930
Why do I have to?

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:55.020
Not another weird event again?!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.740
What are you doing?!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.900
I didn't say anything!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.870
Someone call the headmaster!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.840
To be honest, I called you here to ask you to be on the culture festival committee.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.300
On the culture festival committee?

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:31.430
Yes. We're working hard on the festival, and I need reliable students to organize it.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.930
Oh, if that's all you wanted, then...

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:42.070
It's just that if you join the committee, you'll be working during half your summer vacation.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.820
That's why we don't have any volunteers.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.450
How about it? Why don't you give it a try?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.910
But it's finally time for our summer vacation...

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.160
Oh, I see.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:01.920
Excuse me.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.340
Aoba-kun!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.180
Oh, thanks for your help.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.260
Why is Amamiya-san here?

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:14.350
I was told to come here for a culture festival meeting.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.140
Then that means...

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:21.520
Yes. I'm on the committee.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.780
I see. That's too bad.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:28.070
I really wanted Aoba-kun to help, but...

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:37.080
How about it? Won't you help Amamiya-kun?

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.630
I-I'll do my best.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.380
My summer vacation's gone...

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.680
If you really didn't want to do it, you should've said no.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.470
No, I can't let you do it alone.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.140
I'm not doing it alone.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:05.020
I just want to work hard on the culture festival for everyone's sake.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.870
I-I'll help too!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.370
I'll work hard for everyone!

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.880
Let's make it a culture festival to remember!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.420
Aoba-kun.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:29.380
That's right.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.930
Let's work hard together and make it a great culture festival.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.930
Yeah!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.140
First we have to decide what to display.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:39.930
What did they do last year?

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:40.890
What did they display?

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:45.190
I think we sold chocolate bananas.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:53.280
Headline reads "Date Spots"

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.990
We've just gotta go to the beach.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.860
Or maybe somewhere closer? What about a movie?

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.320
Magazine reads "A Guide to Summer Events"

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.620
I went to all that trouble to get a boyfriend.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:03.270
Date Spots

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.210
I've gotta at least go on a date with him during the summer vacation.

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:04.250
A Guide to Summer Events

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.040
We usually can't see each other due to our club activities.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.260
Is that why he's been acting cold towards me recently?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.640
Anyway, I've got to hang out with Riku-kun all summer!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.430
I'll be dating Riku-kun every day until our clubs start up again!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.430
I've made up my mind!

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:22.230
Oh, Riku-kun.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:25.230
Oh, there were so many people waiting in line.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.900
Yes. I think we should organize other things in addition to stores this year.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.940
Like research presentations or...

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.320
Then what about a presentation on chocolate bananas?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.320
Oh, Aoba-kun!

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:48.040
Here's your melon bread!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.340
Here's your meat sandwich!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:56.590
What?! You have to work on the culture festival committee?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.180
You don't have to act so shocked.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:03.020
But you know, Riku-kun, you're too curious.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:08.810
The culture festival committee carries a triple curse: it's hard, it's painful, and it steals your vacation.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.030
Now your summer vacation's finished.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:17.820
We'll have to enjoy ourselves on your behalf during the summer vacation, too.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.910
Amamiya-san's also on the committee...

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.380
WHAT DID YOU SAY?!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.380
What was that?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.840
This is terrible.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:40.720
You get to be with Amamiya-san during your summer vacation. I envy you.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.850
You don't have to get that depressed over it.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.020
What are you saying?!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.640
You lucky bastard!

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:48.850
Hey...

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:53.030
You still don't understand how serious this is.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.400
There's a story behind it.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:02.620
The Legend of Amamiya Sayuri: Part 5

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.450
It happened during last year's summer vacation.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:11.380
A male student had to come to school every day and clean the animal cages.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:18.970
Amamiya-san saw him and made some handmade sandwiches for him.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:23.220
End of the Queue

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:26.100
After that, the boys lined up one after another to clean the animal cages.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.850
It's been a while since I heard one of those stories.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.900
You bastard! Do you think you've already won?!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:33.980
No!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.400
Excuses won't help you.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.150
Like I said, Sakurai-kun asked me to do it!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.490
U-Um...

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.200
Riku-kun.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.830
K-Kasuga-san!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.160
So hot.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:11:03.050
Please look after the animals.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:50.920
What is it, Kasuga-san?

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.330
Do you have something to tell me?

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.800
You were with Amamiya-san yesterday, right?

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.760
I didn't think you were seeing her, but...

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.300
You seemed quite happy together.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:04.930
That's not it.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:08.020
I'm just working with Amamiya-san on the culture festival committee.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.100
Really?

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.060
Yes!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.060
You don't have any feelings for her?

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.980
Of course not!

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.360
She's just a classmate to me!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.240
That's right.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.030
C'mon, it's been a long time since we went on a date.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.120
Let's see...

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.080
Are you free this Sunday?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.450
What about your club?

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:30.580
Won't you be busy?

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.330
It'll be fine!

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.710
I'll work things out!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.380
So it'll be okay, right?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:38.670
I-I don't mind...

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.170
Then it's a promise!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.190
Okay, first we'll see a movie!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.850
Why don't we go shopping after that?

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.680
So hot.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.650
Yeah, that sounds good!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:57.900
What should I buy?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.900
Should we go buy a swimsuit?

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.030
A swimsuit?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.280
Well, I...

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:08.030
Man, it's summer already.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.120
I have a date with Kasuga-san, and I have to help prepare for the culture festival.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.880
It looks like I'm gonna be busier than I thought this summer vacation.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.430
Are you Aoba Riku-san from class 2-A, perchance?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.140
Yes, I am...

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.140
Who are you?!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.930
Special Technique

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.140
Black Dance

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.900
What's going on?!

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:47.780
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.290
I'm Fujikawa Yuuka. I'm Shinjou Sakura.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.580
What's going on here?!

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.420
What are you going to do with me?!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.970
I welcome you to the Drama Club.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.100
Kurotokage-sensei!

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:11.100
Welcome, Aoba-kun.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:18.610
I knew it. You really are a nice boy.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.520
Um...

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.030
Do you want me to do something for you?

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.530
I shall have you act in a play.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.120
In a play?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:37.210
When I first saw you, I just knew that you had talent for acting.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:41.550
And I would be the one to develop that talent.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.630
Only I, Kurotokage Misao, could do that.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.010
I see.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:48.010
Yes. You cannot live without acting.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.050
You are a play yourself.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.350
Um... I don't know what you're trying to say...

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.560
SILENCE!

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.850
Don't be so rebellious!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.100
Your soul is dancing.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.820
Even the word "play" stimulates it!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:07.030
Now that it's settled, I will have you audition next Sunday.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.200
Understood?

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.660
You can't just force people into doing things!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.660
You're quite strong-willed.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.450
Kurotokage-sensei.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.410
Please let us take care of this.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.170
Is that so?

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.710
Well then, help yourselves.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.420
Drama Club Technique

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.590
Yeah!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.890
Prepare yourself, Aoba Riku!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.220
What the...

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:38.170
Winged Dance

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.980
Stop! Stop! Stop it!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.650
We'll stop if you agree to come to the audition!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:54.080
L-Like I said, I'm not interested in acting!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.870
How about this then?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:05.300
In the end, they made me agree to go to the audition.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.640
Hey, are you listening, Inukai-kun?

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.890
Hey, Inukai-kun.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:19.560
Yeah?

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.820
What? Do you know a way for me to escape from the audition?

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:32.070
Let me know if you pass the audition.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:46.040
Please look after the animals

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.290
What's he on about?

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:40.050
Nah. I don't think that's the case..

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.350
You're surprising. You should go to the play.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.040
That's horrible. Not you too, Hiyoko-kun.

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:48.960
Oh. Come to think of it, Riku-kun... that day.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:50.800
Aoba-kun!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.550
Amamiya-san!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.850
I heard about it, Aoba-kun.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.810
You're gonna audition for the drama club.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.270
Oh, that's...

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:02.640
Do your best.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.190
I'll come to cheer you on.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.020
Really?

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:10.440
Yes. I have something to do at school on Sunday, so I'll drop by.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.860
Okay.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.210
Oh man.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.710
Now I have to go to the audition.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:28.960
Oh well.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:35.390
I'll just fail it anyway, but why does it have to be on Sunday?

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.760
Sunday?!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.850
Go for it! Match today!

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:44.270
It's summer, so should I wear lighter clothing?

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:48.770
Or should I wear more feminine clothes?

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.240
What to do?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.530
Who would call at this hour?

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.200
Riku-kun!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.910
Hello!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.160
What's up, Riku-kun?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.790
Oh, um...

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.000
It's about our date tomorrow.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.670
Yeah! Where should we meet?

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.130
In front of the train station?

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.340
I'm sorry! I can't make it tomorrow!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:20.220
I got forced into an audition for the Drama Club tomorrow, so...

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:23.600
Um...

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.390
Kasuga-san?

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.060
But you promised.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.650
I'm really sorry!

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.770
I'll make it up to you!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.020
Forget it.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.860
Just do whatever you want!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:41.990
Kasuga-san.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.010
You're such a jerk, Riku-kun!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:08.350
Kasuga-san wouldn't answer my calls.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:09.900
I've got no choice.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.520
I'll call her again after the audition.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.110
Do you want to be in a play?

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.530
Come back later!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.250
They all say "Aoba Riku"

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.380
Riku-kun...

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:37.170
Maybe I went too far.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:47.600
I vow that I shall be a shield to protect you, and a sword to defeat all those who would endanger you!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.770
I shall also make a vow. I vow to be a cradle to ease your pain.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.860
I will be a pillar to support you.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.480
Do it again from the beginning.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.240
You're the only one left, Riku-kun.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:07.870
Um...

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:10.830
Come on.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:17.380
Show me your true talent!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:25.680
Um...

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.890
Don't I need a partner?

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.270
This is an audition.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.100
Just pretend your partner is in front of you.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:33.650
Okay...

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:34.900
Um...

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:40.950
I vow that I shall be a shield to protect you, and a sword to defeat all those who would endanger you!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.660
Wrong! Wrong!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.870
I want to see your passion!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:47.620
Show me the passion from the bottom of your heart!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.330
All right.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.580
I don't care how you read your lines.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.580
Imagine there's a girl in front of you.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.710
Speak your true feelings.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.300
That's easy for you to say.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.180
I don't even know what my partner is like.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.720
Just do it!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:05.430
NOW!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.060
Y-Yes!

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.280
I love you.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:31.870
Amamiya-san?

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:33.960
What?

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.130
That was...

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.250
He confessed his love to Amamiya-san!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.670
That was...

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:45.720
Um... That was part of the audition...

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.720
I wasn't confessing my love!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.350
So that was just an accident!

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.520
I didn't mean it like that!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.730
Amamiya-san?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:20:59.940
Listen to me!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:00.690
Amamiya-san!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.030
Amamiya-san?

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:04.950
Like I said, I...

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.870
I-I'm so sorry!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:10.910
She got dumped!

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.620
She sure did.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.210
What is this feeling?

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:06.380
I feel really sad...

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.020
Riku-kun...

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:37.210
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.250
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.220
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:30.260
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.930
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:52.320
Next Episode Preview.

00:23:49.860 --> 00:24:24.240
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.990
You, in that short skirt.

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:54.740
How vulgar!

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:56.780
But it's normal to wear it these days.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:00.120
Your youth won't last forever.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:05.040
You must always look after your skin.

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:06.380
So, um...

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.880
You need to counteract the damage caused by the sun!

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:12.630
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:13.930
An Exciting Time.

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:15.050
Please watch it.

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:24.240
An Exciting Time

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:18.060
Sensei will remain youthful forever.

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:19.350
Oh dear.

00:24:34.270 --> 00:24:39.330
Watch Tokimeki Memorial Next Week Too!
